==Battleground==
*1 [[Illyasviel (Enemy)|Illyasviel]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*7 [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*7 [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rin Tohsaka (Enemy)|Rin Tohsaka]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

